<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Control Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Necromancer (guild level 36)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast control undead &lt;undead&gt;
tell &lt;undead&gt; &lt;command&gt;
tell horde &lt;command&gt;     (all your undead at once)
</pre>
<p>The necromancer utters 'Muera reslox' and bends one of the undead to their 
will: it follows you and obeys you. Command it with tell, for example 
tell ghoul kill rat. Like an animated zombie, it walks, fights, gets, 
drops, gives and follows; anything else, it only moans. It won't attack 
another player unless both of you have signed the Book of Blood.
</p><p>The undead resists, and undead above your level are much harder to 
control; if the spell fails, it attacks you. Each casting also darkens your 
soul: your alignment falls a little toward evil.
</p><p>The control lasts from half a minute to several minutes, the better your 
spell. When the undead begins to tremble, it is about to break free: it 
rebels and attacks you if you are with it, and when it is beaten or you are 
gone, it vanishes, leaving what it carried. You must be standing, and no 
free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
